    sffi_manifest_signature_native_test_compile_cost_2026-08-21, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep2-20261127: measured on fresh seed - the doc's 4-6 min closure compile is unreachable on this Windows host (MC/DC degrade routes to interpreter; pinned native needs the Linux test daemon), so the fix is structural plus contract-pinned. Root cause: every native admission compiled into a run-unique artifact path (native_test_artifact_path_v1 embeds start; temporary path embeds PID+start; cleanup deletes after each run) - zero reuse across runs, so each native test recompiled the whole Ed25519+SHA-256+manifest+mutex closure. Fix (pure-Simple, additive; no signature/semantic changes): native_compile_contract.spl gains native_test_shared_artifact_key_v1/path_v1 - a pure content address (spec path + source digest + producer digest + backend + source roots + library mode + runtime path + SIMPLE_LIB; NO time/PID/nonce) - plus NATIVE_SHARED_ARTIFACT_MIN_BYTES/READY_SUFFIX/MCDC_SUFFIX exports; test_runner_execute.spl explicit-AOT non-coverage lane checks the shared slot, on hit (_shared_native_artifact_valid_v1 = .ready marker + size floor) runs the cached exe with identical child argv, MC/DC sidecar transport and completion checks (compile_ms: 0, cached: true), on miss publishes the fresh exe into the slot via exclusive hard link (atomic, race-safe; losers keep their fresh artifact) with the .ready marker written only after the link succeeds; the gc_async_mut shim re-exports the new symbols. Coverage lane deliberately excluded (per-run instrumented evidence). Spec native_compile_contract_compat_spec extended with the shared-cache contract describe (slot stability, invalidation on every byte-relevant input, no-invocation-leak path shape, cleanup compatibility, legacy parity) 7/7 PASS both modes; manifest signature verifier spec unchanged-behavior 2 PASS with the same degraded token; neighbours temporary_artifact_filename 3/3, native_source_roots 10/10, types 36/36, doctest_child_execution 7/7 PASS; runner_self_coverage 1 failure proven pre-existing on a pristine HEAD scratch worktree. Residuals: end-to-end AOT hit/miss not exercisable on this host (daemon-gated by design; degrades gracefully to today's behavior without hard links); check src/lib not runnable to completion here (45+ min, killed; partial runs clean). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/app/test_runner/native_compile_contract_compat_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/lib/nogc_sync_mut/test_runner/native_source_roots_spec.spl"

